$MDESC::Type = "Tribes Arena";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Tribes Arena" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0>Septa Scarabrae IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0>Warm and a bit muggy. Rain has passed on last night." @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0>Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @  
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing :<f0>The Mono-Rail is new technology made by the Imperial Slime. All of the tribes have decided to steal the technology. But the <vServer::teamName0> and the <vServer::teamName1> were the only ones who survived to see the construction site. Now that the Imperials were out of the way, they quickly found themselves stepping on each others toes and marking territory. So they spilt and each set up camp in the construction barracks. Went out back and then called in backups to clear out their age old enemys. Backups are on the way, but a little too late. All out war has begun. Your sole purpose is to out live the other team, think you are up for it?" @
         "\n\n<f1> Map Concept by: <f0> FunGuns" @
         "\n\n<f1> Map Constructed and Tweaked by: <f0> bosshog" @
         "\n\n<f1> Story Line: <f0> bosshog & FunGuns" @
         "\n\n<f1> Contact: <f0> FunGuns via email, iline@mediaone.net or bosshog via email and ICQ, cline@mediaone.net \ ICQ UIN # 23288753" @
         "\n\n<f1> Special Thanks: <f0> To FunGuns for letting me make his idea come to life and handing it over to me to design. And also to Mike Hamlett at XGN (www.xtremegaming.net) for always posting my work and encouraging me with his great maps! And last but never the least Pokey 'The Tribes Map Maker' for the great tutorial (via earthworm and reference). And for just being cool. Plus giving me sneak peeks at his sweet maps!"@
         "\n\n<f1> Converted to Tribes Arena by: <f0> WT-SlAuGhTeR (Derrick Slaughter)";
